Type: Package
Package: admetshiny
Title: Interactive ADMET and Drug-Likeness Analysis of Small Molecules
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2026-08-29
Authors@R: 
    person("Xavier Clemente", "Garcia Cevallos", , "xgarcia@unicauca.edu.co", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3284-2363"))
Maintainer: Xavier Clemente Garcia Cevallos <xgarcia@unicauca.edu.co>
Description: Integrates code-based tools with a dual 'shiny' application 
    interface to streamline drug discovery workflows. Facilitates the 
    calculation of molecular descriptors via 'rcdk' and 'webchem', standardizes 
    heterogeneous 'ADMET' datasets through its 'ADMET' Master Manager, and applies 
    prominent drug-likeness filters such as 'Lipinski' and 'Veber' rules. 
    Furthermore, predicts pharmacokinetic endpoints including P-glycoprotein 
    substrates and 'BOILED-Egg' parameters, while enabling the generation of 
    publication-ready visualizations and automated statistical reports like 
    'PCA', 'UMAP', and 'AGNES' 'Tanimoto' similarity dendrograms.
